Compared to futures hedging: Futures lock price → no upside if price > futures price. Options protect downside, keep upside.

5. ESG-Linked Derivatives - New Frontier
Mining firms can link derivatives to ESG performance. E.g., if Anglo improves ESG scores, it gets better swap rates.
# Example: ESG-linked swap for Gold Fields
esg_score = 0.7 # 0-1 scale
base_swap_rate = 1850
esg_discount = 20 * esg_score # Better ESG = lower rate
effective_swap_rate = base_swap_rate - esg_discount
print(f'Gold Fields ESG Score: {esg_score}. Effective swap rate: ${effective_swap_rate}')
print('\nTeaching point: ESG-linked derivatives incentivize sustainability.')
# Student Exercise: If Gold Fields improves ESG to 0.9, what’s the new swap rate?
# Solution: esg_discount = 20 * 0.9 = 18. Effective swap rate = 1850 - 18 = $1832/oz.

